      hu: ["A múzeumot hivatalosan 1948. május 1-jén nyitották meg a közönség előtt.", "Az intézmény modern stílusú főépülete 1974-ben készült el.", "A múzeum felügyeli a 6. századi bizánci várost, Caričin Gradot.", "A régészeti gyűjtemény több mint 10 000 katalogizált leletet tartalmaz.", "A néprajzi részleg egy eredeti, 1850-ben épült polgári házban található.", "2015-ben az intézmény elnyerte a Szerbia legjobb múzeuma kitüntetést."],
      ro: ["Muzeul a fost deschis oficial pentru vizitatori la 1 mai 1948.", "Clădirea principală modernă a fost inaugurată în anul 1974.", "Muzeul administrează Caričin Grad, un oraș bizantin important din secolul VI.", "Colecția arheologică cuprinde peste 10.000 de piese inventariate.", "Secția etnografică este găzduită într-o clădire istorică datând din 1850.", "În anul 2015, instituția a primit premiul pentru cel mai bun muzeu din Serbia."],
      en: ["The museum was officially opened to the public on May 1, 1948.", "The current modern main building was completed in 1974.", "The museum manages Caričin Grad, a major 6th-century Byzantine city.", "The archaeological collection includes more than 10,000 cataloged artifacts.", "The ethnological department is located in a traditional house built in 1850.", "It was awarded the title of the Best Museum in Serbia in 2015."],
